 "title": "GTA 6 just tied the highest Metacritic score ever. Deserved?",
 "audio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Lh3gaSoJDsjYAzqFyj65XamsxE/hf_20261119_053251_3349ae29-3a88-42cd-9771-8197658bf709.wav",
 "script": "GTA 6 just tied the highest Metacritic score ever. 99 out of 100, level with Zelda: Ocarina of Time, from 1998. 118 critics gave it a perfect score. That's out of 147 reviews on PlayStation 5. One outlet gave it an 80. But some fans say a score this high can't be real, and the hype is doing the talking. Scores can still move as more reviews arrive. So is GTA 6 really a 99, or just hype? Comment which one.",
